    upsides: [
      "Bislama is the fastest functional language an English speaker can acquire — fluency is measured in weeks.",
      "The 'naghol' season on Pentecost runs Saturdays from April into June, villages in full voice.",
      "No personal income tax — a legal fact that compounds the island pace nicely.",
    ],
    downsides: [
      "Cyclone season is severe, volcanic activity is real, and inter-island transport depends on weather.",
      "Because nearly all land is custom-held, finding a lease means negotiating with the owning community — slow, and rightly so.",
      "Power and connectivity outside Port Vila are solar-and-signal patchy, so remote work has boundaries.",
    ],
